'''Harbinger of the Arcane''' is a [[spell]] that summons an allied Harbinger [[minion]]. The skill is only available through {{il|The Rippling Thoughts}}.

==Skill functions and interactions==
The summoned Harbinger is immortal, and occasionally casts [[Arcane Surge]] on the player. Arcane Surge is a [[buff]] that lasts 4 seconds, with a cooldown of 8 seconds, and grants the following benefits:
* 10% increased Cast Speed
* 30% increased Mana Regeneration Rate

==Drop restrictions==
Harbinger of the Arcane can only be obtained by equipping {{il|The Rippling Thoughts}}.

